 
                           ReadMe cdb2oa
			   -------------
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------			   
Conversion syntax: 			   
cdb2oa -lib <t_libName> -cdslibpath <t_libPath> <options>
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Convesion Steps:
===============
0. Pre-requsite:
   a) Sofware hierarchy:
      Update .cshrc_oa22_sj file with appropriate entry for CDSHOME, IUSHOME, ASSURAHOME
      source .cshrc_oa22_sj
   b) Optional, update FLOW_ETHER_CDK090/share/CDK090
   c) Update cds.lib with the appropriate reference library

1. Optional (these library should available from CDK090), 
   Convert Reference library (technology library and standard cell library):
   % cdb2oa -lib gpdk090 -cdslibpath ../../custom_cdb -log cdb2oa_gpdk090.log
   % cdb2oa -lib gsclib090 -cdslibpath ../../custom_cdb -log cdb2oa_gsclib090.log

2. Convert design library:
   % cdb2oa_x.csh ether_label
   % cdb2oa_x.csh av_hrcx_ether
   % cdb2os_x.csh ether
   % cdb2oa_x.csh ether_sim
   
   Note: Convert directly without clean up (not recommend though):
   % cdb2oa -lib ether_label -cdslibpath ../../custom_cdb -log cdb2oa_ether_label.log
   % cdb2oa -lib av_hrcx_ether -cdslibpath ../../custom_cdb -log cdb2oa_av_hrcx_ether.log
   % cdb2oa -lib ether -cdslibpath       ../../custom_cdb -log cdb20a_ether.log 
   % cdb2oa -lib ether_sims -cdslibpath ../../custom_cdb -log cdb20a_ether_sims.log 
   
   These below libraries are not listed in custom_cdb/cds.lib should direct convert:
   % cdb2oa -lib ether_adcflash_RAD90      -cdslibpath ../../custom_cdb/neowa_gpdk090 -log cdb2oa_ether_adcflash_RAD90.log
   % cdb2oa -lib ether_adcflash_RAD90_sims -cdslibpath ../../custom_cdb/neowa_gpdk090 -log cdb2oa_ether_adcflash_RAD90_sims.log
   % cdb2oa -lib ether_adcflash_VLM90      -cdslibpath ../../custom_cdb/neowa_gpdk090 -log cdb2oa_ether_adcflash_VLM90.log
   % cdb2oa -lib ether_adcflash_VLM90_sims -cdslibpath ../../custom_cdb/neowa_gpdk090 -log cdb2oa_ether_adcflash_VLM90_sims.log
   % cdb2oa -lib ether_adcflash_180      -cdslibpath ../../custom_cdb/neowa_gpdk180 -log cdb2oa_ether_adcflash_180.log
   % cdb2oa -lib ether_adcflash_180_sims -cdslibpath ../../custom_cdb/neowa_gpdk180 -log cdb2oa_ether_adcflash_180_sims.log  
   % cdb2oa -lib iplib_adcflash_RAD180      -cdslibpath ../../custom_cdb/neowa_gpdk180 -log cdb2oa_iplib_adcflash_RAD180.log
   % cdb2oa -lib iplib_adcflash_RAD180_sims -cdslibpath ../../custom_cdb/neowa_gpdk180 -log cdb2oa_iplib_adcflash_RAD180_sims.log  
 
 
3. Run applications on these libraries:
   % cd FLOW_ETHER_CDK090/design/custom_oa22
   
4. Record the regression result in MS-Excell file in "doc" directory.
      
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Mnemonics:
Convert sepecific cell: 
     cdb2oa -lib ether -cell top_1_port_receive -cdslibpath ../../custom_cdb -log cdb20a_ether_receive.log 
     cdb2oa -lib ether -cell PLL_PFD -cdslibpath ../../custom_cdb    
     cdb2oa -lib ether -cell test1_rayv -cdslibpath ../../custom_cdb
